/-!
# Structurality from `Equation3737` through a word companion

Generated by `defwork/wcell.py`, with the proofs `grind` could not find replayed from Vampire by
`defwork/wreplay.py`.  `Equation3737` is `x ◇ y = (x ◇ z) ◇ (y ◇ z)`.  The companion is `x □ y = W(x, y)`:
`haut` says it has no automorphism the magma lacks, which is the whole reverse half of
`StructuralOnMagma` on a finite carrier, and each cell then only has to check the target.
-/

